# Prettier's `mdx` parser implements the MDX v1 grammar and corrupts MDX v3
# syntax this repo relies on (JSX comments `{/* */}` -> emphasis `{/_ _/}`;
# re-indents JSX blocks nested in list items until the closing tag escapes the
# listItem and the file no longer compiles). Content MDX is also the immutable
# ledger — a formatter must not rewrite committed entries at commit time.
